      "cooked": "<p>I was expecting it to be worse than it ended up being.</p>\n<p>Legacy and Lightning as a card-playing engine is heaven for either Benchmark or Luminary, both of whom were able to spin up to their full potential with absurd speed. Captain Cosmic lent some help via bonus power uses, especially once Legacy was using his old Next Generation + Lead From The Front hijinks to shield everyone from energy damage.</p>\n<p>Omega was at 100 HP when he flipped, and then he was at 0 HP at the end of Benchmark’s turn. Luminary didn’t even get to unleash all of his wave after wave of device-based chaos.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2023-06-29T20:42:06.639Z",
